WEBVTT

00:00:03.295 --> 00:00:06.428
In Tools, Features, search for Soft Phone.

00:00:06.428 --> 00:00:09.366
Turn on Telephony Soft Phone Extension.

00:00:09.366 --> 00:00:12.825
It adds the soft phone page that the apps open.

00:00:13.339 --> 00:00:17.348
Then give your users the Use the telephony soft phone permission.

00:00:17.348 --> 00:00:21.753
Open the role your agents have, and search for it in Search permissions.

00:00:21.753 --> 00:00:26.439
The Contact Center's Agent role does not have it by default, so add it there.

00:00:26.912 --> 00:00:32.572
Finally, tell your users the site's domain, for example phone dot example dot com.

